          <p>
            The second issue is measurement conditions. Published figures nearly always describe quarter load or eco mode, measured at 23 feet. Load the same unit to 90% and it will read 6-10 dB higher because the engine throttles up. Our figures in the reviews above are at a realistic mixed household load, which is why they read higher than marketing numbers for the same machines.
